## Facts surfaced at the gate before approval

- Task 301 preserved the enrichment verbatim at `/api/projects/with-stats`; task 302's board test
  is green and proven non-hollow (it fails when task counts are zeroed AND when the project list
  is empty — the a85f7d63 blank-board regression).
- Payload parity verified at the projection level by task 302's panel: `with_stats.rs` and
  `merged.rs` run the same query, map the same 12 shared fields, apply the identical sort, and add
  no LIMIT or filter. Nothing disappears from the board.
- Every surviving reference is inside the task's `files:` list (verified pre-dispatch, G2).
- `TaskCounts` survives (used by `ProjectWithStats`); `handlers/core.rs` needs no edit;
  `impl From<Project> for RemoteNodeProject` (`types.rs:88-110`) is protected (G4).
- This reverses the SHAPE of `a85f7d63` but not its intent — that commit restored the endpoint so
  the board would render; that capability now lives at the new endpoint.

